<!-- FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="sec bg-slate-50" data-section="faq">
 <div class="container-narrow">
 {{ sectionHeader('FAQ', '2-in-1 Hybrid <span class="text-brandOrange">FAQ</span>', '', {max: ''}) }}
 <div class="reveal">
 {% call faqItem("What is a 2-in-1 hybrid charger?", true) %}A 2-in-1 hybrid charger combines a wall AC charger and a portable power bank in a single device. Plug it into the wall to charge your phone directly, then unplug and use it as a power bank on the go. It replaces two devices with one and uses GaN technology for compact size.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("Can a 2-in-1 hybrid charger charge a laptop?", true) %}Yes. The WOP69 model delivers 67W PD output, sufficient to charge most USB-C laptops including MacBook Air, Dell XPS 13, and many ultrabooks at full speed. The WOP67 at 45W charges 13-inch MacBooks and lighter laptops at full speed, and tops up 16-inch MacBook Pro at reduced rate.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("What is the MOQ for 2-in-1 hybrid charger OEM?", true) %}MOQ starts at 500 units for standard ODM models with custom logo printing. Custom OEM with tooling: 1,000-2,000 units. Sample turnaround: 3-7 days for standard, 10-15 days for custom.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("What is the difference between WOP69 and WOP67?") %}WOP69 is the flagship: 67W GaN PD output, 15000mAh capacity, retractable USB-C cable, global plug options. WOP67 is the compact option: 45W PD, 10000mAh, built-in fixed cable. WOP69 suits laptop users and premium retail; WOP67 fits phone-first travel and corporate gift programs.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("Can you take a 2-in-1 hybrid charger on a plane?") %}Yes. All {{ "power-bank" | productFamilyModelCount("2-in-1-hybrid") }} WOWOHCOOL 2-in-1 models are under 100Wh — the IATA limit for carry-on lithium batteries without airline pre-approval. The largest model (WOP69, 15000mAh) is only 55.5Wh. UN38.3 certified with complete MSDS documentation for international air freight.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("Is a power bank with wall charger better than a regular power bank?") %}For travelers and minimalist users, yes. A 2-in-1 hybrid replaces both a wall charger and a power bank, reducing carry weight by 30-40% and simplifying packing. For brands, it commands 40-60% higher MSRP than a standalone power bank of the same capacity, with one SKU instead of two.{% endcall %}
 {% call faqItem("What plug types are available for OEM orders?") %}We offer 6 plug standards: US (Type A), EU (Type C), UK (Type G), AU (Type I), India (Type D), and South Korea (Type F). All models support 110-240V wide voltage. Select models (WOPA01, WOPA09) feature swappable plug adapters for multi-region retail distribution.{% endcall %}
 </div>
 </div>
</section>

